This notice replaced an MIT License on 8 August 2026.

The MIT text had been in place while `docs/TERMS.md` — which ships to every user
— said the software is not open source and may not be redistributed. Those two
documents granted and withheld the same rights, and both were shipping. This
notice resolves that in favour of the terms and of the project's actual position.

It has not been reviewed by a lawyer. It is a plain statement of intent, not
drafted advice, and it should be checked before AuralFM is distributed to anyone
outside a private circle.
